# Lean-code (alias)

`lean-code` = `ponytail.mdc`. Same ladder. Same Soft Rule.

Hard size roof: `hooks/lean_gate.sh` checks projected post-edit LOC (700 max). Edits that reduce or split oversized files always pass. Never fight a deny.
Off only: stop ponytail / stop lean-code / normal mode.
